      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a7 8. Solely with respect to housing area 2B of the North Infirmary Command, I hereby direct the suspension of Board of Correction minimum standards \u00a71-03(c-d, j) (Personal Hygiene); 1-04(b)(2-3) (Single Occupancy, including storage and desk space); 1-06 (Recreation); 1-07(c) (Religion); 1-08(f)(4) (Law Library Access); 1-08(g)(2-4) (Legal Documents and Supplies Access); 1-09(c-d, f) (Visiting); 1-11(c-d) (Correspondence); 1-12(d) (Incoming Packages); 1-13(a-c) (Publications); and 1-14(a-b) (Access to Media), to allow the DOC to utilize this area for special safety and security purposes.",
